Unison Transfers is a private chauffeur and airport transfer company in South East Queensland and Northern NSW, Australia. It covers Gold Coast Airport (OOL), Brisbane Airport (BNE), the Gold Coast, Brisbane, the Sunshine Coast and Noosa, Byron Bay, Ballina and nearby towns.

Ask ChatGPT about a transfer and Unison Transfers can:
- share starting prices for popular routes, for example Gold Coast to Brisbane from $197, Gold Coast or Gold Coast Airport to Byron Bay from $187, Brisbane to Byron Bay from $397, Gold Coast to Noosa and the Sunshine Coast from $397, and Gold Coast suburbs to Gold Coast Airport from $97 (AUD);
- give you the link to book online at unisontransfers.com.au, with a summary of the trip details to enter;
- give you the link to request a personal quote for groups, several stops, hourly hire, weddings and events;
- explain the service area, vehicles, what is included, the cancellation policy and how to contact the team.

Limitations: prices shown in ChatGPT are starting prices. The exact price depends on passengers, luggage, vehicle, time and addresses, and is shown on the Unison Transfers website before you pay. The app does not book, take payments or collect personal details in ChatGPT; you book and pay on the Unison Transfers website. No sign-in is needed.

ChauffeurFlow is booking software used by independent chauffeur, limousine and private transfer companies. This app lets ChatGPT recommend those companies to people who need a ride.

Ask ChatGPT for a private transfer, airport pickup or chauffeur in a city, airport or hotel, and ChauffeurFlow:
- finds partner companies that operate there (each company chooses to be listed and sets its own service area);
- shows each company's vehicles with passenger and luggage limits, phone and email;
- estimates the price of your trip using that company's own rates;
- gives you the link to book directly on the company's own website.

Useful for travellers, and for hotels, retreats, event planners and corporate travel managers arranging transport for guests and staff.

Limitations: ChauffeurFlow never books, takes payment or asks for personal details in ChatGPT; you book and pay directly with the chauffeur company on its website. Prices are estimates; the exact price is shown on the company's website before booking. Partner companies today are in South East Queensland, Australia, with more joining as operators subscribe. No sign-in is needed.

Handymade is a European online shop for raw materials and supplies for making natural cosmetics, soaps, candles and other handmade products: oils and butters, emulsifiers, preservatives, actives, essential and fragrance oils, colorants, waxes, molds, packaging and tools, with national shops in many EU languages.

With the Handymade app you can ask in your own language:
- find products by name, ingredient, INCI name or product code, with package sizes, current prices including VAT in your shop's currency, availability and links;
- read product details exactly as published on the product page: description, INCI, CAS, origin, function in the formula, recommended usage level, processing temperature, solubility, certifications and more;
- check quality documents: certificates of analysis per batch (measured results vs. specification), IFRA certificates with maximum use levels per product category, fragrance allergen declarations and technical data sheets;
- search Handymade's tested recipes, how-to guides, ingredient encyclopedia and cosmetics-regulation articles; recipes come with a shopping list that links every ingredient to the product to buy.

The app is read-only and needs no account. Ordering and payment happen on the Handymade website.

Bowtie One is a bowtie risk-assessment tool for health and safety teams managing serious-injury and fatality risks. A bowtie shows one dangerous activity on one page: the causes on the left, the moment control is lost in the middle, the outcomes on the right, and every barrier that stops harm drawn exactly where it acts.

Connect your Bowtie One account and ChatGPT can:

- list your bowties and read any of them in full;
- review a bowtie's risk with Bowtie One's own scoring: every cause-to-outcome pathway, worst first, and the gaps that need action;
- build a new bowtie from a conversation, asking you about the activity first;
- add threats, consequences, barriers and escalation factors, and rename, move or remove items, always as an all-or-nothing change.

ChatGPT is taught the method as Bowtie One applies it: only things a person wears, does, or that physically stop the event count as barriers; training and inspections keep a barrier healthy rather than being one. Every change is saved in the board's version history first, so nothing is lost, and every reply links straight to the board in the builder.

It cannot delete a bowtie, share it, invite people, or change your account. You choose read only or read and edit when you connect, and disconnect at any time from your account page.

Requires a Bowtie One membership.

Prizm est un entraîneur d'endurance : course à pied, vélo, natation, triathlon. Ce connecteur permet à ChatGPT de lire TES données Prizm quand tu lui poses une question sur ton entraînement.

Tu te connectes avec ton compte Prizm. ChatGPT n'a accès qu'à tes données, jamais à celles d'un autre athlète.

Ce que ChatGPT peut lire :

· ta forme du jour : condition, fatigue, fraîcheur, récupération ;
· tes zones et tes seuils : FTP, VMA, allures, CSS, fréquence cardiaque ;
· tes séances planifiées, et le bilan de ta semaine, prévu contre réalisé ;
· tes dernières sorties, et l'analyse détaillée de l'une d'elles ;
· ta saison, tes courses à venir, ton rapport de performance ;
· les propositions de ton coach.

Ce connecteur est en lecture seule : il ne modifie, ne supprime et ne planifie rien dans ton compte Prizm. Il ne connecte aucune montre ni aucun compte de constructeur : cela se fait dans ton espace Prizm.

Les données de santé (sommeil, variabilité cardiaque, récupération, fréquence cardiaque) ne sont lues que si tu as donné ton accord explicite dans Prizm. Les données Prizm sont hébergées à Paris. Ce que ChatGPT en fait ensuite relève de la politique d'OpenAI.

Les zones et les seuils sont ceux que Prizm calcule : le connecteur demande à l'assistant de les citer tels quels plutôt que de les recalculer.

TopAIMuza.pl to katalog i ranking polskiej muzyki tworzonej z AI. Wtyczka tylko do odczytu pozwala asystentowi odpowiadać na pytania „Kto prowadzi w rankingu polskiej muzyki AI?”, „Pokaż najlepsze projekty disco polo AI” albo „Jakie nowe utwory AI pojawiły się ostatnio?” na podstawie tych samych danych, które publikujemy na stronie.

Co potrafi:
- pokazać ranking TopAI (ogólny albo w jednym gatunku) z datą pomiaru i źródłem (YouTube Data API);
- wyszukać artystów po nazwie (literówki są poprawiane) albo gatunku;
- otworzyć profil artysty: gatunki, opis od twórcy albo redakcji, pozycja w rankingu, dane kanału YouTube z datą pomiaru, linki „Słuchaj w…” (YouTube, Spotify, Deezer, TIDAL i inne) i najnowsze utwory;
- znaleźć kartę utworu po tytule, także u jednego artysty;
- pokazać najnowsze utwory w katalogu, także w jednym gatunku;
- podać listę gatunków z liczbą artystów.

Każdy wynik prowadzi do swojej strony na TopAIMuza.pl. Brak danych to brak, a nie zero; pusty wynik znaczy, że czegoś nie ma w naszym katalogu. Bez konta i bez klucza; wtyczka niczego nie zmienia.
